    "Copy, paste, undo, close, quit, and standard text formatting keep their system shortcuts. Slash, Return, and Tab remain editor input rules." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kopieren, Einsetzen, Widerrufen, Schließen, Beenden und Standardformatierungen behalten die Systemkurzbefehle. Schrägstrich, Return und Tab folgen den Editorregeln."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copy, paste, undo, close, quit, and standard text formatting keep their system shortcuts. Slash, Return, and Tab remain editor input rules."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copiar, pegar, deshacer, cerrar, salir y el formato estándar conservan los atajos del sistema. La barra, Retorno y Tab siguen las reglas del editor."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copier, coller, annuler, fermer, quitter et les formats standard gardent leurs raccourcis système. Barre oblique, Retour et Tab suivent les règles de l’éditeur."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "コピー、ペースト、取り消し、閉じる、終了、標準の文字書式にはシステムのショートカットを使います。/、Return、Tab は編集入力の規則に従います。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "복사, 붙여넣기, 실행 취소, 닫기, 종료 및 기본 텍스트 서식은 시스템 단축키를 유지합니다. /, Return, Tab은 편집 입력 규칙을 따릅니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "复制、粘贴、撤销、关闭、退出和标准文字格式保留系统快捷键。斜杠、回车与 Tab 仍遵循编辑输入规则。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "複製、貼上、復原、關閉、退出和標準文字格式保留系統快速鍵。斜槓、Return與 Tab 仍遵循編輯輸入規則。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
