    "Keep nearby — Drag the top to move, an edge to resize. Use the pin to stay on top or the arrow to fold." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In der Nähe — Oben ziehen zum Verschieben, am Rand zum Skalieren. Mit der Stecknadel oben halten, mit dem Pfeil einklappen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keep nearby — Drag the top to move, an edge to resize. Use the pin to stay on top or the arrow to fold."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tenla cerca — Arrastra la parte superior para mover y un borde para cambiar el tamaño. Usa la chincheta para fijar o la flecha para plegar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gardez près de vous — Déplacez par le haut, redimensionnez par un bord. L’épingle garde au premier plan, la flèche replie."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "そばに置く — 上部をドラッグして移動、端をドラッグしてサイズ変更。ピンで最前面、矢印で折りたためます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "곁에 두기 — 위쪽을 드래그하여 이동하고 가장자리로 크기를 조절하세요. 핀으로 맨 위에 고정하고 화살표로 접으세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "贴放：拖动顶部移动，拖动边缘缩放；图钉置顶，箭头折叠。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "貼放：拖動頂部移動，拖動邊緣縮放；圖釘置頂，箭頭折疊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
