    "Undo restores your edits, including supported block operations. Standard copy, paste and undo shortcuts work inside the editor." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Widerrufen stellt Text und unterstützte Blockaktionen wieder her. Die üblichen Kurzbefehle für Kopieren, Einsetzen und Widerrufen gelten im Editor."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Undo restores your edits, including supported block operations. Standard copy, paste and undo shortcuts work inside the editor."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deshacer revierte tus cambios, incluidas las acciones de bloque compatibles. Los atajos habituales de copiar, pegar y deshacer funcionan en el editor."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Annuler rétablit vos modifications, y compris les actions de bloc prises en charge. Les raccourcis habituels de copie, collage et annulation fonctionnent dans l’éditeur."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "取り消しは文字と対応するブロック操作を元に戻します。エディタ内では通常のコピー、ペースト、取り消しのショートカットが使えます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "실행 취소로 텍스트와 지원되는 블록 동작을 되돌릴 수 있습니다. 편집기에서 기본 복사, 붙여넣기 및 실행 취소 단축키를 사용할 수 있습니다."
